        "created_at": "2012-04-03T22:45:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Not to disagree with your overall answer, but in the glossary, for Limited, it says, “If a limited card with the same name as a limited card already in play would come into play, the second card is put into the appropriate trash instead.”  So, in fact, it is very specific about what to do if the situation occurs.</p>",
